。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是州长的长期伴侣</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">父親</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちちおや</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">父亲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209033\">その<ruby>少年<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>父親<rp>(</rp><rt>ちちおや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>似<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">男孩继承他的父亲。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">知能</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちのう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">智力；智能；脑力</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228455\">イルカは<ruby>非常<rp>(</rp><rt>ひじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>知能<rp>(</rp><rt>ちのう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>動物<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">海豚是非常聪明的动物</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">地平線</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちへいせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地平线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202585\"><ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>つき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>地平線<rp>(</rp><rt>ちへいせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあった。</span><span clas