=\"zh-Hans\">来吧 给我一个机会</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ちゃんと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">认真地；踏实地；可靠地；正当地；完美地；正确地；整齐地；准时地；安全地；状态良好；充足地；令人满意地；迅速地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220270\">この<ruby>道具<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はちゃんと<ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えばとても<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果使用得当,这一工具将大有帮助。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">中</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">中等；中级；中等程度；在…之中；当中；在…期间；在…过程中；正在进行中；处于…状态中；中道；适度；温和；第二卷；中卷；初中；中学；中国</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">注</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">注释；说明；批注</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126363\"><ruby>注<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はページの<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>した</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>欄<rp>(</rp><rt>らん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>についている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">笔记在页面底部。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">中央</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅう