v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">頂上</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">顶端；顶点；峰顶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125848\"><ruby>頂上<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>美<rp>(</rp><rt>うつく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">太阳从顶部升起是美丽的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうだい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">接受；获得；收到；吃；喝；用餐；请（给我；为我做）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75697\"><ruby>市民<rp>(</rp><rt>しみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>皆様<rp>(</rp><rt>みなさま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>御<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>意見<rp>(</rp><rt>いけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をちょうだいする<ruby>予定<rp>(</rp><rt>よてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们计划征求公众的意见。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">貯金</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちょきん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">存钱；储蓄；存款；（棒球）胜场多于负场的场数差；胜负差盈余</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"93098\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をたくさん<ruby>貯金<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她把很多钱放一旁</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">直接</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちょくせつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">直接的；无中介的；亲身的；第一手的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154536\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>直接<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょくせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>その<ruby>情報<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>入手<rp>(</rp><rt>にゅうしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我直接从他那里得到情报</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">著者</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちょしゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">著者；作者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219748\">この<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>著者<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>誰<rp>(</rp><rt>だれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这本书的作者是谁?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塵</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">灰尘；尘埃；垃圾；废物；污垢；尘土；微不足道的量；极少量；尘世喧嚣；世俗烦扰；俗世尘劳；（相扑）尘手水；力士赛前搓掌展臂、表示手无暗器光明交锋的仪式动作</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143903\"><ruby>塵<rp>(</rp><rt>ちり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>積<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もれば<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>となる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">积土成山。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/11071279\" title=\"Tatoeba · jin1\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · jin1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">チーズ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">奶酪；芝士；三通接头；T形接头；（拍照时说的）茄子</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215640\">ジョージは<ruby>朝<rp>(</rp><rt>あさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にたくさんのチーズを<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">乔治早餐吃了很多奶酪</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">チーム</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">团队；队伍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111972\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はチームでダントツの<ruby>好選手<rp>(</rp><rt>こうせんしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是球队里最好的球员</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遂に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">最终；终于；到底；结果；终究；始终（未发生）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111891\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はついに<ruby>大学<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>学長<rp>(</rp><rt>がくちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>辞任<rp>(</rp><rt>じにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他终于辞去学院校长一职了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通過</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通过（隧道、车站、城镇等）；经过；过境；通过（议案等）；批准；获得通过；通过（考试、检查等）；及格；获得资格</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125585\"><ruby>通過<rp>(</rp><rt>つうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">小心路过车</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通学</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">上学；上下学</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203957\">たいていの<ruby>学生<rp>(</rp><rt>がくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>徒歩<rp>(</rp><rt>とほ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>通学<rp>(</rp><rt>つうがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">大多数学生步行去学校。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1735642\" title=\"Tatoeba · sadhen\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · sadhen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通行</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通行；通过；交通；通用；广泛使用</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224289\">ここは<ruby>大型車<rp>(</rp><rt>おおがたしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>通行<rp>(</rp><rt>つうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>禁止<rp>(</rp><rt>きんし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这里没有大车的通道</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通信</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通信；通讯；传输；音信；信号；电信</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"115376\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>無電<rp>(</rp><rt>むでん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>通信<rp>(</rp><rt>つうしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>送<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他通过无线发送了一个信息。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通じる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうじる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">开放通行；连通；沟通；流动；通过；传达；被理解；被领会；得到认可；行得通；精通；熟悉；秘密联系；与敌方保持联络；建立联系；有来往；亲密；广泛传播；散布</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"87767\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>つう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じるとすぐ<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她一经过就开始说话了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">捕まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つかまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">被抓住；被逮捕；抓住；握住；找到；得到；被拘留；被扣留</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192278\">ロープにしっかり<ruby>捕<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まりなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">抓紧绳子</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">掴む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つかむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抓住；握住；捏住；拿住；紧握；抓取；获得；获取；得到；赢得；占领；理解；领会；把握</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216017\">ジムはジュリーの<ruby>腕<rp>(</rp><rt>うで</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をぐいと<ruby>掴<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">吉姆抓住了朱莉的手臂。</span></div></li>"]